    {
      "source": "The <code>postProcessors</code> represent methods to be exposed once the\ninstance has been created to further configure it. Each method should\naccept two parameters, the <a href=\"../support/RegisteredBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>RegisteredBean</code></a> and the bean\ninstance, and should return the modified bean instance.",
      "translation": "<code>postProcessors</code> 代表在实例创建后暴露以进一步配置它的方法。每个方法应接受两个参数，即 <a href=\"../support/RegisteredBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>RegisteredBean</code></a> 和 bean 实例，并返回修改后的 bean 实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
